---

<div class='not-found'>
    <h1 class='not-found-code text-center'>404</h1>

    <p class='bubble bubble-shadow-right text-center'>
        This page doesn't exist. Either the link is broken or it moved somewhere else.
        Nothing is lost — let's get you back.
    </p>

    <div class='btn-wrap'>
        <div class='shadow'></div>
        <a class='face' href='/'>Back to home</a>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .not-found {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    /* El contorno negro de 10px del h1 global solo funciona a tamaño display */
    .not-found-code {
        font-size: clamp(4rem, 16vw, 9rem);
        line-height: 1;
    }
</style>
